:''This article is about the enemy. For the Cat Unit, see [[HUGE HERMIT (Uber Rare Cat)]].''
'''HUGE HERMIT''' is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Metal Slug Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 4.3 Update|Version 4.3]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = HUGE HERMIT
|image = E 194.png
|appearance = [[Metal Slug Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 1,000¢ - 3,950¢
}}

==Enemy==
Not a threat by itself, HUGE HERMIT is here to slow your progress and prevent you from hitting the main boss of the stage, either being [[JUPITER KING (Enemy)|JUPITER KING]] or [[HI-DO (Enemy)|HI-DO]].

==Strategy==
Exploit this enemy's low range by using damaging Cats and you won't have issues. Since this enemy attacks fast, however, you'll need a solid defence in order to keep it into place. This can be done by meatshields such as [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cat]] or [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Tank Cat]].

[[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera Cat]] is particularly effective against this enemy, he can tank HUGE HERMIT's hits well and can knock him back.

